{"id":51872,"date":"2026-06-30T07:45:55","date_gmt":"2026-06-30T06:45:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:31:15","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:31:15","slug":"trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trofeu-ctr-viver-santarem\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>, capital do Ribatejo. Fruto de uma organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta entre a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Circuito Trail do Ribatejo (CTR)<\/strong>, a <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m (AAS)<\/strong>, a <strong>Viver Santar\u00e9m<\/strong> e o <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>, a prova integra o <strong>Circuito Nacional de Trail da ATRP<\/strong>, o <strong>Circuito Regional AAS<\/strong> e o prestigiado <strong>Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com quartel-general no <strong>Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m<\/strong> (Jardim de Cima), os participantes t\u00eam \u00e0 escolha o desafiante <strong>Trail Longo de 31 km<\/strong> (08:30), o <strong>Trail Sprint de 19 km<\/strong> (09:00), o <strong>Mini-Trail de 12 km<\/strong> (09:30) e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> pelas deslumbrantes encostas da cidade e matas envolventes, contando ainda com a <strong>Kids Race gratuita<\/strong> e acesso livre \u00e0s piscinas do complexo durante todo o dia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-wi