: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 13:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (com lanche e tshirt)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com partida, chegada e secretariado no Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m (Jardim de Cima).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Para que circuitos oficiais pontua a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento pontua para o Circuito Nacional de Trail da ATRP (S\u00e9rie 100 e Jovem 150), para o Circuito Regional da AA Santar\u00e9m e para o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas decorrem no domingo: Trail Longo 31K \u00e0s 08:30, Trail Sprint 19K \u00e0s 09:00, Mini-Trail 12K e Caminhada 10K \u00e0s 09:30, e a Kids Race \u00e0s 13:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito \u00e0 utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o do Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, todos os atletas e participantes t\u00eam entrada gratuita no Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m durante todo o dia da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a prova Kids Race CTR \/ McDonalds?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Kids Race \u00e9 totalmente gratuita e destina-se a jovens dos 6 aos 15 anos com dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas (200m a 2000m), incluindo lanche, t-shirt e acesso ao complexo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m, Jardim de Cima\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Circuito Trail do Ribatejo \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m \/ AA Santar\u00e9m\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail CTR \/ Viver Santar\u00e9m 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 13 de setembro de 2026, com partida, chegada e secretariado no Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m (Jardim de Cima).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Para que circuitos oficiais pontua a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento pontua para o Circuito Nacional de Trail da ATRP (S\u00e9rie 100 e Jovem 150), para o Circuito Regional da AA Santar\u00e9m e para o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e respetivos hor\u00e1rios de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As partidas decorrem no domingo: Trail Longo 31K \u00e0s 08:30, Trail Sprint 19K \u00e0s 09:00, Mini-Trail 12K e Caminhada 10K \u00e0s 09:30, e a Kids Race \u00e0s 13:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito \u00e0 utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o do Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, todos os atletas e participantes t\u00eam entrada gratuita no Complexo Aqu\u00e1tico de Santar\u00e9m durante todo o dia da prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a prova Kids Race CTR \/ McDonalds?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Kids Race \u00e9 totalmente gratuita e destina-se a jovens dos 6 aos 15 anos com dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas (200m a 2000m), incluindo lanche, t-shirt e acesso ao complexo.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66154,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[727,39],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-51872","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_3-sim","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-ctr-viver-santarem-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51872","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com